      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹13.15 (down from ₹14.10 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹829.5m (down 2.1% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹48.6m (down 6.7% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.9% (down from 6.2% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 26% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 1% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
